# Settings > Updates P2 (report 047): the first start of the old launcher after a rollback (the helper put 0.8.12 back
# when 0.8.13 did not start, then restarted it): one toast "Update to 0.8.13 failed / Rolled back to 0.8.12" on the
# home grid, once per helper run (update.state rollback_seen). The "Updated to" toast of P1 is not shown (the version did
# not change). Review only: no golden.
title updates rollback toast
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:35 2026-11-04
wifi 70
bt on
update build 0.8.12 release arm64
update state last_shown 0.8.12
update state last_check now-300
update state result ok
update state available 0.8.13
update state notified 0.8.13
update cache releases-0.8.13.json
update helper state rolled-back
update helper step rollback
update helper from 0.8.12
update helper to 0.8.13
update helper variant appliance
update helper started now-240
update helper updated now-60
update helper reason 0.8.13 did not start
home
wait 300
shot updates_rollback_toast
expect_text end "Rolled back to 0.8.12"
